+
+# Rental service availability query
+
+Added `availability(query)` to the rental service in `src/index.ts`, test-first (`test/rental.test.ts`,
+run with `npm test`). It returns the sorted ids of the equipment, of the given kind or of any kind, that
+is free for the whole period. Semantics are in dl-002-availability-query-semantics.
+
+- Reuses the period parsing and overlap rule of `book`.
+- Invalid period or unknown kind throws.
